Load [`.cursor/rules/issue-workflow.mdc`](issue-workflow.mdc) and [`docs/handoffs/worktree-branch-topology.md`](../../docs/handoffs/worktree-branch-topology.md) — Merge Queue primary; sync-before-merge is fallback only (see issue-workflow).
